<title>USA: Triple P in talks to cut workforce.</title>
<headline>Triple P in talks to cut workforce.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Netherlands-based Triple P NV said on Tuesday it is in talks with its various Works Councils regarding possible job cuts in the Netherlands and Germany.</p>
<p>The number of employees affected has not yet been determined, the company said. Further details concerning these discussions will be made available upon completion of the negotiations.</p>
</text>
